{"ID":"20240206093150-y1qetac","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240206093150-y1qetac","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093150-y1qetac\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206093200-gsaxp4v\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607131522-8tj2bjo\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2300,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240620105201-8z1vyzw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:5,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"081徐长卿","type":"doc","updated":"20240808084224"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206093200-gsaxp4v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093200-gsaxp4v","updated":"20240206093203"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产江苏、浙江、湖北、安徽等地。\n【性状】\t本品根茎呈不规则柱状，有盘节，长0.53.5cm，直径24mm。有的顶端带有残茎，细圆柱形，长约2cm，直径12mm，断面中空；根茎节处周围着生多数根。根呈细长圆柱形，弯曲，长1016cm，直径1"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.5mm。表面淡黄白色至淡棕黄色，或棕色；具微细的纵皱纹，并有纤细的须根。质脆，易折断，断面粉性，皮部类白色或黄白色，形成层环淡棕色，木部细小。气香，味微辛凉。\n【性味】\t辛，温。\n【功效】\t祛风化湿，止痛止痒。用于风湿痹痛，胃痛胀满，牙痛，腰痛，跌扑损伤，荨麻疹、湿疹。"}]},{"ID":"20240206093155-oh32om4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206093155-oh32om4","updated":"20240206093155"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206093155-p2vhn4g.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620104858-3k02614","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620104858-3k02614","updated":"20240808081946"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 462px;","style":"width: 452px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"徐长卿"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/徐长卿-20240620104858-mwmw30q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 452px;\" parent-style=\"width: 462px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 463px;","style":"width: 453px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"徐长卿3"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/徐长卿3-20240620105250-2qdf3z2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 453px;\" parent-style=\"width: 463px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240620105201-8z1vyzw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620105201-8z1vyzw","updated":"20240808082853"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 349px;","style":"width: 339px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"徐长卿 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/徐长卿 6-20240808082853-ohal7jo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 339px;\" parent-style=\"width: 349px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 679px;","style":"width: 669px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"徐长卿 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/徐长卿 5-20240808082546-1jgu655.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 669px;\" parent-style=\"width: 679px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240808082253-8acbtk7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240808082253-8acbtk7","updated":"20240808082513"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 617px;","style":"width: 607px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"徐长卿 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/徐长卿 1-20240808082253-44cyztw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 607px;\" parent-style=\"width: 617px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 593px;","style":"width: 583px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"徐长卿 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/徐长卿 4-20240808082513-bip25ci.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 583px;\" parent-style=\"width: 593px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240620105055-th9i36o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240620105055-th9i36o","updated":"20240808082409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 702px;","style":"width: 692px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"徐长卿1"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/徐长卿1-20240620105055-5ouhvyc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 692px;\" parent-style=\"width: 702px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 504px;","style":"width: 494px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"徐长卿 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeClos